sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: HTTP acceptance, completion and domain result are separate
  accDescr: Caller receives complete 202 acceptance, later retrieves a complete 200 whose representation says rejected; status and framing completion do not decide the business outcome.
participant C as Caller
  participant S as Service
  C->>S: POST /imports
  S-->>C: Complete 202 + reference
  Note over C,S: Accepted processing<br/>Completion not established
  C->>S: GET result reference
  S-->>C: Complete 200<br/>domain state: rejected
  Note over C,S: HTTP completion and status<br/>Product outcome is separate
